## 🚀 How to use Prettier (proper setup)

### 1. Set it as default formatter (IMPORTANT)

Press:

```
Ctrl + Shift + P
```

Search:

```
Format Document With...
```

Then:

```
→ Configure Default Formatter
→ Select Prettier
```

---

### 2. Enable auto format on save

Open settings JSON:

```
Ctrl + Shift + P → Preferences: Open Settings (JSON)
```

Add this:

```json
{
  "editor.defaultFormatter": "esbenp.prettier-vscode",
  "editor.formatOnSave": true
}
```

---

### 3. Optional (but recommended): create config

In your project root:

```bash
touch .prettierrc
```

Add:

```json
{
  "semi": true,
  "singleQuote": true,
  "tabWidth": 2
}
```

